meta {
  name: getBrands
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getBrands",
    "params": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 3
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve brands

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
  | `brand_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by internal brand IDs |
  | `external_brand_id` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by your system's reference IDs for brands |
  | `include_brand_images` | boolean | no | Include brand images in the response |

  **Example: First page of brands**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getBrands",
    "params": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 3
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "brands": [
      {
        "brand_id": 1,
        "brand_name": "Acme",
        "external_brand_id": "ACME"
      },
      {
        "brand_id": 2,
        "brand_name": "BrandX",
        "external_brand_id": null
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 2,
      "items_per_page": 3,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
